Option Flavour Natural
' Words.nat - mistakes with a project class's words (Tally.cls) and with words of your own
with tally 1
bump
say "a"
jump 3
say "b"
if lost say "x" end
value
if value is above 3
  to helper say "x" end
end
to using size
end
to twice using n multiply n by 2 say n end
twice
say "c"
with tally
say "d"
to last say "x"
